<title>USA: Omaha hogs $0.25/0.50 higher - USDA.</title>
<headline>Omaha hogs $0.25/0.50 higher - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were $0.25-0.50</p>
<p>higher. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3    220-260 lbs    58.50</p>
<p>Sows: 10 percent. Steady to 1.00 lower. Top 48.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3    350-500 lbs    46.00</p>
<p>US 2-3    500-700 lbs    48.00</p>
</text>
